<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Starting window: a stand-in for the home screen (clock, top bar, hero, dock band and inputs as plain shapes),
     laid out for a 960x540dp 1080p TV, so launching never flashes white. Dark whatever the look chosen later. -->
